OL,3,GNEWSADying man's wish to see Highland
OL,4,Acow fulfilled
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman said she was in tears after
OL,7,Ffulfilling a man's dying wish to see a
OL,8,FHighland cow one more time.
OL,10,FChristopher Cooksey has had a soft spot
OL,11,Ffor the cattle since courting his wife
OL,12,Fon holiday in the Scottish Highlands.
OL,14,FThe 89-year-old's family appealed
OL,15,Fonline in the hope that one of the
OL,16,Fanimals could come to his bedside at
OL,17,Fhome in Basildon in Essex.
OL,19,FLocal cattle owner Chloe Lucas answered
OL,20,Fthe callout and said: "I am so blown
OL,21,Faway. I spent most of the day crying
OL,22,Fyesterday. It was just incredible."
